 s-blood/
SUMMARY:Ghost Ship Halloween Featuring Nelson's Blood
DESCRIPTION:\nAhoy me mateys —&nbsp\;and Happy Halloween from all of us h
 ere at Jack of the Wood! \n\n\n\nJoin us for our Ghost Ship Halloween cele
 bration! Don your patches &amp\; parrots\, your bracers &amp\; bangles\, a
 nd your boots &amp\; booty for this one-of-a-kind pirate party that you wi
 ll only find right here at Jack! \n\n\n\nGhoulish grogs &amp\; pirate punc
 hes aplenty\, late-night food\, and a costume contest — pirate garb enco
 uraged!Entertainment will be provided all night by Asheville's premier pir
 ate band\, Nelson's Blood! That's right folks\, we have a legit pirate ban
 d. Be there\, lest ye be square.Music 8:30-11:30pm $10 cover at the door.\
 n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/09/10-31-26_NelsonsBlood-HALLOWEEN_IG_1080x1440.jpg
END:VEVENT
