 vening will be especially focused on blues—with Drew on guitar\, Stig St
 iglets on bass\, Peter Mencher on drums\, and Ben Balmer on harmonica—so
  it's not a show you'll want to miss!!!\n\n\n\nmusic 8:30-11:30pm $10 cove
